---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import cashQuoteImg from '../assets/images/johnny-cash-too-long.jpg';
---

<Layout
  title="About Me | Mateus Tavares"
  description="Learn about Mateus Tavares — Full-Stack Software Engineer based in Calgary, AB with expertise in Ruby on Rails, React, TypeScript, and Frontend UI design."
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="container container-readable">
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">About Me</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Full-stack software engineer with a strong frontend soul.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- About in 30 Seconds -->
      <section class="about-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">About me in 30 seconds</h2>
        <div class="cash-card">
          <Image
            src={cashQuoteImg}
            alt="Johnny Cash Quote"
            width={738}
            height={300}
            class="cash-image"
          />
        </div>

        <ul class="quick-facts">
          <li>Full-Stack Software Engineer currently building fintech products at ZayZoon</li>
          <li>4+ years of Ruby on Rails experience building scalable backend APIs and web services</li>
          <li>Deep frontend roots specializing in TypeScript, React, component architecture, and UI performance</li>
          <li>Previous experience: 2 years at Dooly and lead web engineering at Wishpond</li>
          <li>Based in Calgary, AB 🇨🇦. Father, Husband &amp; Johnny Cash enthusiast</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <!-- About in Detail -->
      <section class="about-section prose">
        <h2 class="section-title">About me in detail</h2>

        <p>
          Hello, I'm Mateus. Or Mat for short. I've heard so many variations of my name in different languages over the years that I find it easiest to introduce myself using the first three letters of my name.
        </p>

        <p>
          My journey into software engineering started on the frontend. From the very beginning, I was drawn to user interfaces, web performance, component design, and crafting polished user experiences. Early in my career at Wishpond, I took charge of building and maintaining our web infrastructure and interactive marketing tools. That hands-on experience sparked a deep passion for full-stack application development.
        </p>

        <p>
          Over the past several years, I expanded into full-stack engineering, accumulating 4+ years of hands-on experience with Ruby on Rails alongside modern JavaScript/TypeScript ecosystems. I spent 2 rewarding years as a Software Engineer at Dooly, building workflow tools for revenue teams. Today, I'm at ZayZoon, engineering financial technology solutions that empower workers across North America.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">Frontend Craft &amp; Engineering Mindset</h3>
        <p>
          Even though I build end-to-end full-stack applications. From relational database schemas and API endpoints down to server infrastructure. My roots remain firmly planted in frontend craft. I care deeply about the details that make software a joy to use: clean UI architecture, responsive design, fast page load speeds, and intuitive micro-interactions.
        </p>

        <p>
          I use this site to write about software engineering, frontend patterns, Ruby on Rails development, and web performance experiments.
        </p>

        <h3 class="subsection-title">Life Outside of Code</h3>
        <p>
          I'm originally from the state of São Paulo, Brazil 🇧🇷. Today, I live in Calgary, Alberta with my wife and two boys. In my free time, you'll usually find me coaching my older son on the soccer field, playing guitar, biking around the city with family, or relaxing with video games.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 0 5rem 0;
  }

  .container-readable {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .about-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .subsection-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--brand-sage);
  }

  .cash-card {
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cash-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .quick-facts {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .quick-facts li {
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .divider {
    border: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--border-color);
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }
</style>
